{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777272449653","title":"ReadableStream membuat browser ikut memproses respons LLM secara progresif","desc":"Dengan ReadableStream, client tidak lagi menunggu payload lengkap; ia membaca respons HTTP sebagai aliran yang bisa dirender sebagian demi sebagian.","updated":1777427658317,"created":1777272449634,"tags":["zettel","ai","browser","streaming","ux","the-developers-guide-to-ai","chapter-2"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"78a05726352dd4beeb6c6907d6f4f21e","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.browser","alias":"browser","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.browser"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.streaming","alias":"streaming","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.streaming"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ux","alias":"ux","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ux"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.chapter-2","alias":"chapter-2","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.chapter-2"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":3,"offset":1997},"end":{"line":52,"column":51,"offset":2045},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449653","id":"zettel.1777272449653","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":3,"offset":2048},"end":{"line":53,"column":48,"offset":2093},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","id":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":3,"offset":1819},"end":{"line":26,"column":27,"offset":1843},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449653"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"penjelasan":{"type":"header","text":"Penjelasan","value":"penjelasan","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2},"quote-baseline":{"type":"header","text":"Quote baseline","value":"quote-baseline","line":39,"column":0,"depth":2},"catatan-teknis":{"type":"header","text":"Catatan teknis","value":"catatan-teknis","line":43,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":59,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":65,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"readablestream-membuat-browser-ikut-memproses-respons-llm-secara-progresif\">ReadableStream membuat browser ikut memproses respons LLM secara progresif<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#readablestream-membuat-browser-ikut-memproses-respons-llm-secara-progresif\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Dengan membaca respons server sebagai <code>ReadableStream</code>, frontend bisa menerima dan merender output LLM sedikit demi sedikit saat server masih menghasilkannya. Ini mengubah respons HTTP dari \"payload final\" menjadi \"alur data progresif\".</p>\n<h2 id=\"penjelasan\">Penjelasan<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#penjelasan\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini penting karena dia menunjukkan momen ketika tiga hal akhirnya ketemu:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>model menghasilkan output secara bertahap,</li>\n<li>server meneruskan output itu sebagai stream,</li>\n<li>browser membaca respons secara progresif.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dalam cara lama, developer sering menganggap request web seperti:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>kirim request,</li>\n<li>tunggu sampai selesai,</li>\n<li>terima seluruh respons,</li>\n<li>baru proses dan render.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Untuk LLM, pola itu terasa jelek karena model sendiri bekerja token/chunk by chunk. Di sinilah <code>ReadableStream</code> jadi jembatan teknis: browser tidak lagi pasif menunggu paket akhir, melainkan aktif mengonsumsi data sepotong demi sepotong.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quote-baseline\">Quote baseline<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#quote-baseline\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The fetch function allows you to call your server and read its response as a ReadableStream.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"catatan-teknis\">Catatan teknis<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#catatan-teknis\"></a></h2>\n<p>Dalam praktiknya, alur kliennya kira-kira seperti ini:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>fetch(url)</code> ke server aplikasi,</li>\n<li>ambil <code>response.body</code>,</li>\n<li>gunakan <code>getReader()</code> atau <code>TextDecoderStream</code>,</li>\n<li>baca chunk secara berulang,</li>\n<li>append teks ke UI setiap kali chunk tersedia.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Itu juga mempertegas titik penting quote: bukan \"call the model directly\" tapi \"call your server.\" Artinya pola arsitektur yang sehat biasanya tetap:</p>\n<p>browser → your server → provider/model</p>\n<p>Server tetap bertugas menyimpan API key, merakit prompt, filtering, logging, dan mengirim response stream kembali ke client.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<p><code>ReadableStream</code> mengubah mental model HTTP untuk AI app dari batch-thinking ke stream-thinking. Ini cocok banget untuk text generation karena setiap chunk teks masih punya nilai parsial dan bisa langsung tampil.</p>\n<p>UI yang terasa hidup di AI app bukan sekadar efek kosmetik; ia berdiri di atas primitive platform browser, kontrak server, dan strategi rendering progresif.</p>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Chapter 2</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">browser (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">streaming (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ux (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">chapter-2 (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as 